        "text": "17.5 ORGANIZATION OF HUMAN NERVOUS SYSTEM\n\nHuman nervous system is a typical centralized nervous system. However, centralized nervous system is the characteristic of most animals, from flat worm to chordates, but human nervous system is the most advanced among them.",
