        "text": "21.1 EMBRYONIC DEVELOPMENT\n\nThe progressive changes which are undergone before an organism acquires its adult like form constitute the embryonic development. It begins with a series of mitotic divisions in the zygote. These early divisions of the zygote are called cleavages.",
