        "heading": "21.3 HUMAN EMBRYONIC DEVELOPMENT",
        "headingUrdu": "موضوع 8",
        "text": "21.3 HUMAN EMBRYONIC DEVELOPMENT\n\nA normal pregnancy lasts nine months. Each three-month period of pregnancy is called a trimester. During each trimester, the fetus grows and develops.",
