        "headingUrdu": "موضوع 12",
        "text": "21.4.4 Breast Feeding Vs Bottle Feeding:There are advantages and disadvantages to both breastfeeding and bottle-feeding.\n\nAdvantages of Breast feeding:\n\n⚫ Breast milk has perfect balance of nutrient.\n\n• It is easily digested and absorbed.\n\n⚫ Breast milk is always at perfect temperature.\n\n• Milk is readily available at any time and any place.\n\nAdvantage of Bottle feeding\n\n⚫ The only advantage is anyone can feed the baby. Presence of mother is not\n\nnecessary.\n\nDisadvantages of Bottle feeding\n\n⚫ It can create unhygienic circumstances for the baby.\n\n• It is vulnerable to carry various types of infections.\n\n⚫. It can cause indigestion and several stomach disorders.\n\nNot as efficiently utilized as breast milk.\n\nSome babies have difficulty in utilizing certain nutrients of the bottle milk. Bottle fed babies also have the risk of developing an allergy to a particular formula. When a baby develops an allergy to formula, he or she may have symptoms that include irritability, crying after feedings, nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, or a skin rash.",
