        "headingUrdu": "موضوع 9",
        "text": "23.4 DNA AS HEREDITY MATERIAL\n\nWhen the chromosome theory of inheritance was confirmed in 1910, geneticist started think over the issue that, in which form, the heredity units are found in the chromosome. It was known that chromosomes contain both DNA and protein.\n\nawaz e inqilab.com\n\nChromosomes and DNA\n\nChapter 23\n\nOn which of these was the heredity information written? Over a period of 30 years, starting in the late 1920s, a series of investigators addressed this issue, resolving it clearly. Here, we are going to learn three experiments, each of which yields a clear answer in a simple and elegant manner.",
