        "heading": "26.7 GENOME MAPS",
        "headingUrdu": "موضوع 17",
        "text": "26.7 GENOME MAPS\n\nThe genome is a collection of all the genes found in one complete set of chromosome. So a diploid organism has two copies of genome while egg or sperm has one.",
        "paras": [
          "26.7 GENOME MAPS",
          "The genome is a collection of all the genes found in one complete set of chromosome. So a diploid organism has two copies of genome while egg or sperm has one."
        ],
        "urdu": "",
        "pashto": ""
