        "heading": "26.11.7 Hazards and social/ethical implication of using biot",
        "headingUrdu": "موضوع 36",
        "text": "26.11.7 Hazards and social/ethical implication of using biotechnology:\n\nThe field of biotechnology has had a lot of beneficial contribution in the area of healthcare, agriculture, food production, manufacture of industrial enzymes, and appropriate environmental management. However, the advancement in this field has also lead to some concerns and controversies raised by a number of groups, NGOs etc. ELSI is the short form to represent the ethical, legal, and social implications of biotechnology. ELSI broadly covers the relationship between biotechnology and society with particular reference to ethical and legal aspects.",
        "paras": [
          "26.11.7 Hazards and social/ethical implication of using biotechnology:",
          "The field of biotechnology has had a lot of beneficial contribution in the area of healthcare, agriculture, food production, manufacture of industrial enzymes, and appropriate environmental management. However, the advancement in this field has also lead to some concerns and controversies raised by a number of groups, NGOs etc. ELSI is the short form to represent the ethical, legal, and social implications of biotechnology. ELSI broadly covers the relationship between biotechnology and society with particular reference to ethical and legal aspects."
        ],
